<trans-unit id="12024"><source>Twist Sensitivity</source><target state="translated">Vridningskänslighet</target></trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="12026"><source>Sets the twist scaling factor.</source><target state="translated">Anger vridningens skalningsfaktor.</target></trans-unit>
